Redrob Film
Redrob Film is an agent-driven video editor. Its code came from FilmCraft
(https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft) at tag v0.6.0, commit
2ff3f5e266838700c292a35aaf762e3d4dcef980, and its Effects editor (editors/effects/) from
EffectCraft (https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft) at commit
0311bdc34d0dc10c2d18ff7875b4f52d483e5e27. Neither is synced any more: Redrob Film is
developed on its own from that point. Files taken from them keep their license, and the
full license texts are retained in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE (and, for the Effects
editor, in editors/effects/ beside its own NOTICE). See SOURCE_ORIGINS.md.
